  "about": {
    "title": "About Us",
    "ownerName": "Tarek Kharita",
    "ownerRole": "Owner & Master Tailor",
    "paragraph": "Atelier Kharita is a tailoring and alterations studio built on craft and care. Whether it's shortening, taking in, or repairing trousers, jackets, dresses, or curtains, we treat every piece like it's worth keeping. Bring it in, and we'll give it a second life.\n\nWith 35 years of experience in the trade, Tarek Kharita is a craftsman through and through. His passion for tailor-made clothing and pattern design began in Syria, where he worked as a tailor from 1990 to 2015: from working for various companies to running his own business and a sewing workshop.\n\nSince coming to the Netherlands, Tarek has continued his craftsmanship, including assignments for De Bijenkorf Amsterdam and at Atelier Shekho, where he handles clothing repairs and made-to-measure work.\n\nWhat sets Tarek apart is his combination of craftsmanship, attention to detail, and a strong customer-focused approach. As an independent and solution-oriented entrepreneur, he delivers quality regardless of circumstances, whether it's a repair or a complete tailor-made garment. Tarek is fluent in Syrian Arabic and has a good command of Dutch and English, and is ready to make or repair your clothing with precision and care.",
